{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8a1bbd96cd4ff93ee20db2b65031f44b87820b0dd4943d6c9c57801d30563790", "ja": "未来？　こんなところでどうしたんだ。\n着替えないのか。", "zh": "未来？你在这里做什么？\n不去换衣服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "6b087968fc33dc118acad98bff7c28736db5ee74da416fe3b5e7b8203d7175a8", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nえへへ……ちょっと、ボーッとしてました。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n嘿嘿……我刚刚发呆了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1003_p", "source_sha256": "cac39fbf5c0487c4a31b963d9744e5a4638a2660e4384a690932ac31787bc722", "ja": "大丈夫か？\n早く着替えて帰らないと。", "zh": "你还好吧？\n赶快换好衣服回家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "4b1c5eb712b011ba58baedd66a18a3052f55c680c8afef30b45982628b7da52b", "ja": "わかってるんですけど……\nなんか、着替えちゃうのがもったいないっていうか。", "zh": "我知道……\n但又觉得换下来有点可惜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "6658bdfb9bf331e92614c9ccf00f49dc593fa240fbc2f521e3161f822d6363d2", "ja": "今日のライブ、すっごくすーっごく楽しかったんです♪\nだから、まだ終わってほしくないなって……でへへ。", "zh": "因为今天的演唱会真的非常非～常开心♪\n所以，我不希望就这样结束……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1006_p", "source_sha256": "305b6fea9ed9093c5e4164f8282c18dd1266b6c3c23456172982bd550ba4e91e", "ja": "そうか。Princess Starsに相応しい、\nいいステージだったものな。", "zh": "原来如此。毕竟今天你们不负『PRINCESS STARS』之名，\n表演得非常棒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "79eb80821e3595b6410e380818e586256f172423f0707b53264cf54ed0e07914", "ja": "はいっ♪\nみんなで新しい曲を歌って、合宿もして……。", "zh": "是啊♪\n大家一起唱新歌，还去集训……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "95e8befbae53a3e60ffb3efddbeb6e2c6b822c0359b0303913937dbe5b50d0b7", "ja": "私、本当に楽しかったです！\n忘れられない思い出になっちゃいそうですよ～！", "zh": "我真的好开心！\n感觉会成为非常难忘的回忆～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1009_p", "source_sha256": "dbdba6d60492319dbca6cbf7826227d4e21997872b0bdac3dfdc68421d262316", "ja": "いいことじゃないか。\nでもその思い出は、これからどんどん増えるけどな！", "zh": "这样很好啊。\n不过那样的回忆，今后还会不断增加喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "071a9b72be7ae28f3df21535de58bd0a3ca97451c9618818dbef7fb086405c83", "ja": "増える？", "zh": "不断增加？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1011_p", "source_sha256": "869d35cdc9c9c17cbed6f6d71250e21cc43303af46b0327c0bc52320386ef7ea", "ja": "ああ。未来のアイドルとしての思い出なんだ。\nこれから先は、増える一方だぞ。", "zh": "是啊。未来在偶像这条路上的回忆，\n从今以后只会越来越多喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "0f27a21851d97f225e5bfcacb5844a2f926330065d5e69c1aa8070279ffb22f5", "ja": "そっか……そっか～！\n私、まだまだひよっこアイドルですもんね！", "zh": "对耶……原来如此～！\n因为我才刚当上偶像嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "a636d5161c6ae51acd8dc8b9e87f99db1e135a8848a4a3e1306d0b90dd01f093", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nなんだかすごく楽しみになってきちゃいましたっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n我现在觉得好期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1ba9afb44dad229c187260350e294ac3ef49dfa73b965d4c26c6cc24badba6ae", "ja": "そうだな。俺も、楽しみにしてるよ。", "zh": "是啊。我也很期待喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "28123f3ab03ee610245198185927c516e3cd060d308f4e4697604dc5fafe1a4e", "ja": "はいっ！　{$P$}さん、\n私、明日からまた頑張ります！", "zh": "好的！{$P$}先生，\n我明天起也会继续加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0043_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "433adb4d9e61182caeb403dd30592651425358a46fcdb9b2a28168cd43a24934", "ja": "だからこれからも一緒に、思い出を作ってください！\n明日も、明後日も……ずーっと一緒に、ですよ♪", "zh": "所以今后也请和我一起创造更多回忆！\n不只明天还是后天……我们永远都要一起努力喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
